{"title": "Knock Unconscious", "pageid": 34058, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Knock_Unconscious", "categories": ["Class actions", "Melee weapon attacks", "Actions", "Sources of Bludgeoning damage"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Toggle_Non-Lethal_Attacks.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d9/Toggle_Non-Lethal_Attacks.webp/300px-Toggle_Non-Lethal_Attacks.webp, /w/images/d/d9/Toggle_Non-Lethal_Attacks.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d9/Toggle_Non-Lethal_Attacks.webp/300px-Toggle_Non-Lethal_Attacks.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d9/Toggle_Non-Lethal_Attacks.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Knock Unconscious</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Class_action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Class action\">class action</a> that deals minor, non-lethal damage. <a href=\"/wiki/Marcus_Falgor\" title=\"Marcus Falgor\">Marcus</a> will use it when trying to capture <a href=\"/wiki/Isobel_Thorm\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Isobel Thorm\">Isobel</a>.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Make a non-lethal attack against a creature. \n</p><p>If the attack would kill the creature, you <a href=\"/wiki/Knocked_Out_(Condition)\" title=\"Knocked Out (Condition)\">Knock it Out</a> instead.\n</p>\nKnocking companions unconscious will <a href=\"/wiki/Downed_(Condition)\" title=\"Downed (Condition)\">Down</a> them.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a></dd><dt>Damage: 2~12</dt><dd class=\"bg3wiki-damage-display\" style=\"margin-left:0px\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;width:fit-content\"><span style=\"display:block;position:relative;width:30px;height:30px;margin-left:0px;padding-top:0px;margin-right:2px\"><span style=\"z-index:0;position:absolute;transform:translate( 0%, 0%)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2b/D6_Physical.png/27px-D6_Physical.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2b/D6_Physical.png/40px-D6_Physical.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2b/D6_Physical.png/54px-D6_Physical.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2b/D6_Physical.png/27px-D6_Physical.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/2b/D6_Physical.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><div><div style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-bludgeoning\">2d6</span><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bludgeoning\" title=\"Bludgeoning\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bludgeoning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Bludgeoning\" title=\"Bludgeoning\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-bludgeoning\">Bludgeoning</span></a></div></div></div></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Melee Weapon Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Melee Weapon <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Roll</a></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png/25px-Melee_Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png/38px-Melee_Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Melee: 1.5 m (5 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png/25px-Melee_Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Melee: 1.5 m (5 ft)</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/20/Party_Icon.png/25px-Party_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/20/Party_Icon.png/38px-Party_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/20/Party_Icon.png/50px-Party_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Targets: Isobel only\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/20/Party_Icon.png/25px-Party_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/20/Party_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Targets: <a href=\"/wiki/Isobel\" title=\"Isobel\">Isobel</a> only</dd></dl>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Target_HAV_TakingIsobel_KidnapperKO</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_HAV_TakingIsobel_KidnapperKO\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_HAV_TakingIsobel_KidnapperKO\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/wiki/IsHarmful_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsHarmful (spell flag)\">IsHarmful</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsMelee_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsMelee (spell flag)\">IsMelee</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Knocked_Out\"> Condition: Knocked Out </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Knocked_Out_(Condition)\" title=\"Knocked Out (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/97/Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/97/Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/97/Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Knocked Out\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/97/Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/97/Knocked_Out_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Knocked_Out_(Condition)\" title=\"Knocked Out (Condition)\">Knocked Out</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>The affected entity which was permanently <a href=\"/wiki/Hostile\" title=\"Hostile\">hostile</a> before cannot <a href=\"/wiki/Movement_Speed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Movement Speed\">move</a> or take <a href=\"/wiki/Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Action\">actions</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Bonus_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Bonus Action\">bonus actions</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Reaction\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reaction\">reactions</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Marcus_Falgor\" title=\"Marcus Falgor\">Marcus Falgor</a>\n</p>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715060411\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.067 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.070 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2522/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 41442/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 14782/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 35/1000\nLua time usage: 0.015/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1178878/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time 